A9, AOL search, Alltheweb, Ask, Bing, Blinkx, Buscamundo, Dogpile, Excite, Foxnews, Google, Infospace, Live, Lycos,
Metacrawler, Metaspy, MSN, Terra, Webcrawler, webpile, Yahoo[br]
e outros mecanismos de busca menos populares.[br]
